spec AC6. No change needed there.\n\n`frontend/src/components/UndoToast.jsx` and `frontend/src/components/TaskList.jsx` needed no edits \u2014 they were never the source of the bug.\n\n**Verification run this session:**\n- `npm run build` (in `frontend/`) \u2014 passed, no errors.\n- `npm run lint` \u2014 could not run; the sandbox required approval that wasn't granted in this headless session (repeated \"This command requires approval\" with no way to proceed). This is a real gap, not a claim of a passing lint.\n- No frontend test suite exists in this repo (`package.json` has no `test` script, no test files found under `frontend/src`) \u2014 pre-existing, out of scope for this fix, not something I introduced.\n- Backend untouched; no backend verification needed.\n\n**Files changed (already in working tree, not committed):** `frontend/src/App.jsx`, `frontend/src/App.css`, `frontend/src/components/UndoToast.jsx` (new), plus `docs/design.md`/`docs/spec.md` from earlier stages.\n\nReady for re-review. Reviewer should specifically re-check the \"Clear completed\" race repro from the original finding (delete a done task, click \"Clear completed\" before the 5s window elapses) to confirm no crash \u2014 I traced through the logic but couldn't drive the UI myself here.", "meta": {"native_type": "assistant", "block_type": "text", "session_id": "4cdea1cf-131d-4ded-910f-3f2468bbbc29"}}
